      "description": "Working on: Internal product development, web studio development, and custom projects.\n\nStack and technologies: Amazon ECS LAMP stack with PHP Laravel Framework and Vue frontend.\n\n2021 highlights: Worked with small team to develop and redesign CRUD operations for a light CRM fundraising platform. Features included stepped setup process, drag and drop form builder, frontend theming UI/X system for end users, payment and frontend forms.\n\n2020 highlights: Worked with small team to develop, release a peer to peer fundraising platform on a short three month timeline. In addition to new development, this process entailed constructing and deploying API integrations with an existing application under the company's umbrella.\n\nOngoing responsibilities: Maintenance and feature development for existing products, including database and query optimization, minor feature releases (examples: image cropping tool, frontend table filters, new API methods). Working with the web studio team to assist in server maintenance and WordPress development. Custom development projects for various clients.",
